{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Runi</strong>, you and your friends are dropped into a beautiful but unforgiving wilderness where survival is never guaranteed. Work together or strike out on your own as you gather resources, craft tools, and build shelters to withstand the elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Runi is alive with challenges: harsh weather, scarce food, dangerous wildlife, and the constant threat of the unknown. Every decision matters \u2014 do you venture deeper into the wilds for rare resources, or fortify your base to prepare for what\u2019s coming? The land is full of hidden secrets waiting to be uncovered, but only the resilient will survive long enough to find them.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4033720?t=1758638422","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4033720?t=1758638422","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033720/e6e8143e5489e73df05fbb726ec8b74feb7938da/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758638422","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033720/e6e8143e5489e73df05fbb726ec8b74feb7938da/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758638422","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Runi</strong>, you and your friends are dropped into a beautiful but unforgiving wilderness where survival is never guaranteed. Work together or strike out on your own as you gather resources, craft tools, and build shelters to withstand the elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Runi is alive with challenges: harsh weather, scarce food, dangerous wildlife, and the constant threat of t